    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: ExpressionSet records (pricing procedures) with UsageType null or blank.
Why it matters: ARM can&apos;t route the procedure — it never fires, and quotes fall to default pricing instead of the configured procedure. Admins see the procedure in Setup and assume it&apos;s working; it isn&apos;t.
Suppress a finding: for procedures intentionally staged but not yet wired.
Disable the detector: leave on when ARM pricing procedures are in use.</value></values>
